# AIDC Studio — publication boundary (neutralization stream N3, 2026-09-15; from docs/legal/publication-exclude.draft.txt).
# Path patterns are ROOT-ANCHORED (leading "/") so they never hide a same-named folder deeper in the tree.
# The old unanchored "assets/" also hid apps/web/public/assets (our own generic models) — LICENSE-AUDIT M11.
# apps/web/public/assets/** and apps/web/public/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt are PUBLISHED on purpose: keep them free of
# third-party content (checked by tools/licenses/check-publication.mjs).

## dependencies, build output, caches
node_modules/
/apps/web/dist/
dist/
.vite/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/tools/asset-pipeline/.venv/
/engines/godot/.godot/
*.log
.DS_Store

## private: live project data and local third-party downloads (never published)
/data/
/assets/

## private by default: research notes, QA scripts and captures (publish later only a reviewed allowlist)
/docs/research/

## audit working papers stay private; the final notices are at the repository root
/docs/legal/*

## screenshots and page crops (re-shoot with own generic models; keep captures out of git)
/screenshots/
**/__screenshots__/
deck-p*.png
